{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0484_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0484_1000_p", "source_sha256": "af349b1e683bff3ce0230d7c3fa95604b3edaa78266f6fa14f520b942e9d9ba8", "ja": "（『カーニヴァル・ジャパネスク』のPVが公開！\nまつりはPRも兼ねて、音楽イベントに参加している）", "zh": "（《嘉年华・日本风》的PV公开啦！茉莉还兼顾宣传，参加了音乐活动）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0484_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0484_1001_audience", "source_sha256": "e782e5818eba5abedd44e01e1ace725eef3945dc4d4aec6052c5a870f092251b", "ja": "アンコール！　アンコール！！", "zh": "安可！安可！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0484_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0484_1002_021mat", "source_sha256": "14153c28bbc8f8d791136807fcccd24641dfb1ac420561458d674d409630eb7f", "ja": "はいほー！　{$P$}さんも\nちゃんと楽しんでいるのです？", "zh": "嘿咻——！{$P$}先生也玩得很开心吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0484_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0484_1003_p", "source_sha256": "a797b88fc10aa953f1def62161359c6cf64ece68c7ce8c7266a6448177f247c8", "ja": "ああ、もちろん！　ファンのみんなも盛り上がってるし\nプロデューサーとして鼻が高いよ。", "zh": "啊，当然！粉丝们也都很兴奋，作为制作人，我可是倍感自豪。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0484_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0484_1004_021mat", "source_sha256": "5048c54daeb3ab0364d680723d779b80965fcf7dcc0dc3a68741a317ea1b1ff3", "ja": "そうではないのです！　パーティーの参加者として\n楽しんでるか聞いてるのです！", "zh": "不是那样的啦！我是想问，您作为派对参加者，玩得开心吗！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0484_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0484_1005_p", "source_sha256": "49ba169c97b1634555fa70dc539fe7451a25a8e373f70a17cd12d419033de15b", "ja": "なるほど……！　そういうことなら心配いらないよ。\nまつりのファンとしても、楽しんでるからな。", "zh": "原来如此……！既然是这样，那就不用担心了。\n作为茉莉的粉丝，我也正享受其中呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0484_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0484_1006_021mat", "source_sha256": "175722397c59d8cbbf3f961e9a235604f1df5c5b0f7fdbcf76b680ef1dec461b", "ja": "それならよかったのです♪　姫のパーティーは、\nみんなが笑顔じゃないとダメなのです。", "zh": "那就好啦♪　公主的派对，\n大家都要笑着才行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0484_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0484_1007_021mat", "source_sha256": "cb032fe047266dcb694c09a5df12937d14ed87afcc7df3037b5d92b234768724", "ja": "当然、みんなの中には、\n{$P$}さんもいるのですよ。", "zh": "当然，“大家”里面，\n也是包括{$P$}先生的哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0484_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0484_1008_p", "source_sha256": "16d36c20bde1ff4cc1f5996c475e351da1109953b906b118905395d18d69af2b", "ja": "まつり……。ありがとう。", "zh": "小祭……谢谢你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0484_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0484_1009_021mat", "source_sha256": "d99b34df3d2c185b84d8aa441e521cc814af8ce95c7a480eb24c61bcf0ac325f", "ja": "ふっふっふ……感極まったところで、\n{$P$}さんにサプラーイズなのです！", "zh": "呵呵呵……就在感动得不得了的时候，\n给{$P$}先生来个惊喜哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0484_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0484_1010_p", "source_sha256": "58b0e970a7154805b730c7b8b8c1de11e8ba344e7e958f428d8b770162b6c66a", "ja": "えっ？", "zh": "咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0484_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0484_1011_021mat", "source_sha256": "4a816b6452f215b2d826eb8b60bb2765197f1069b723d6e2c1b94d7df5f5bd89", "ja": "この後のアンコールは、舞台を一望できる\nすぺしゃる・し～とでステージを観てほしいのです。", "zh": "接下来的返场演出，请用能够一览舞台的特别座位观看哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0484_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0484_1012_021mat", "source_sha256": "7f2a7d7c2be18e241cab4ecfb4cad6c10cc23dd6ea2b89ca6c48b75872ea1c5f", "ja": "普段から姫たちのために頑張ってくれている\n{$P$}さんへの恩返しなのです！", "zh": "这也是为了平日里一直为姬们努力付出的\n{$P$}先生所做的回报哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0484_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0484_1013_p", "source_sha256": "83ba9200fc1fb90de0cc3db180efeb8599e02de35f202d94a3daefd3b0ed00e7", "ja": "特等席！？　って、スタッフさん達も頷いてるな。\nいつの間に相談なんて……。", "zh": "特等席！？连工作人员也都点头了啊。\n什么时候商量好的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0484_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0484_1014_021mat", "source_sha256": "be6ab3455d026b2830ad488a933cede2be2eec7f6f965741b70328335feb3eec", "ja": "{$P$}さんが\n本番前の打ち合わせに出かけた時なのです♪", "zh": "就是趁{$P$}先生\n去进行演出前的碰头会的时候哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0484_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0484_1015_021mat", "source_sha256": "c2764df2439129cc6c64e1507c29f5a135972c17b792abd1f7ab9f6995ff74d4", "ja": "「姫の恩返しを手伝ってほしい」と伝えたら、\nみなさん、快く協力してくれたのです。", "zh": "只要跟她们说“希望能帮公主报恩”，\n大家就很爽快地答应帮忙了呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0484_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0484_1016_p", "source_sha256": "01e833f0e16c3a83836aff3709aa40354a99072f7b0d4486244def0cad3c05c6", "ja": "そうだったのか……。\nわかった。まつりの気遣いに甘えようかな。", "zh": "原来是这样啊……\n好吧，那就接受小祭的好意吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0484_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0484_1017_021mat", "source_sha256": "8f12577ec316777f91bf3bf6752ea8ed6bee4459eda7c681609288b1be263a17", "ja": "はいなのです！\n姫がこれから使う魔法は、おひとり様限定なのです。", "zh": "是的！\n公主接下来要使用的魔法，仅限一位客人。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0484_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0484_1018_021mat", "source_sha256": "48b8463635fb2902d1a6472b2d1b833cf213097f8ccabbdff0fbe040a9528a91", "ja": "パーティーやお祭りは、賑やかで、\n色々なものに目移りしてしまうものですが……。", "zh": "聚会和庆典总是热闹非凡，让人不禁被各种事物吸引目光……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0484_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0484_1019_021mat", "source_sha256": "883e4f5962a0b02bcb6374d18b2b96242562b7cfe751860996484beb93126fba", "ja": "ナイト様には、やっぱり\n姫だけを見ていてほしいのです……ね♪", "zh": "对于骑士大人，果然还是希望您只看着公主……呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0484_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0484_1020_p", "source_sha256": "fc793f2fb3f6941aa65065ff0b7ef139a5d6e3805eefa75f1ef516c5d7342e2b", "ja": "ああ！　まつりのアンコール……全力で応援するよ！", "zh": "啊！我会全力支持小祭的安可演出！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0484_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0484_1021_021mat", "source_sha256": "8285cf932be2020084af9acd7a50fda8baf79373d5dfb1843f94e63a002b4b06", "ja": "ふふっ。そろそろ休憩も終わりなのです……。\nお喋りはここまでにして、お祭り再開なのですよ♪", "zh": "呵呵。差不多该结束休息了哦……\n闲聊就到这里，庆典要重新开始啦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0484_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0484_1022_p", "source_sha256": "35bd9bc5d9d800b131e53a0b92a8f6fe00c92656057c56126bc6b4cefadc0d0a", "ja": "（まつりの優しさで、心が温かくなった気がするな。\n……って、こうしちゃいられない。席に急げ～！）", "zh": "（感觉心里被茉莉的温柔暖了一下。\n……不对，现在可不能这样。快回座位吧～！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
